# Drizzle migration SQL (drizzle/migrations/**), if you generate any with
# `npm run db:generate`, IS meant to be committed — it's a record of schema
# changes. db/dasdum_mysql_schema.sql (the phpMyAdmin-importable baseline)
# is also committed.

